DIGITAL DOWNLOAD: Love Quotes Bundle – Cut Files.
This listing is for a DIGITAL FILE (s) and no physical product will be mailed to you.
What do you receive?
You will receive 1 ZIP FOLDER containing the following files:
-1 SVG Folder -15 SVG files;
-1 EPS Folder -15 EPS files;
-1 DXF Folder -15 DXF files;
-1 PNF Folder -15 PNG files (transparent);
Please make sure that you have the appropriate software to open and cut the files. These designs are best suitable for Silhouette Cameo, Cricut, Sure Cuts A Lot and Scan N Cut cutting machines.
